#message 8 "Prakash: \"And take the camera off the filing cabinet. Evidence you can't show me didn't happen.\""
#message 9 "Prakash: \"I hear you made an arrest. Good. Now the paperwork, Reyes. Give me that report.\""
#message 10 "Prakash: \"Warehouse 9 on Pier Road. Bukowski is parked out there. Radio for backup before you go in. That is not a suggestion.\""
#message 11 "Prakash: \"You've got a timeline problem and a sticker off a crate. Records keeps the property ledger, north down the hall. Find out who rents what.\""
#message 12 "Prakash: \"Kowal is on Main Street by his van, and Hollis Pharmacy is next door. Listen to the first. Photograph the second.\""
#message 13 "Prakash: \"You haven't checked Kowal's story yet. Drivers keep a delivery manifest. Ask to see it.\""
