#message 21 "The drawers are full of old parking tickets. Nothing you need."
#message 22 "You already have the camera."
#message 23 "Walk over to the filing cabinet first."
#message 24 "You take the department camera and check the counter. Twenty-four exposures left."
#message 25 "The department camera. It has a flash and twenty-four exposures left."
#message 26 "You need a camera for that."
