#message 49 "Through the window you can see the red brick of the hardware store across Main Street."
#message 50 "The clock reads a few minutes past eight."
#message 51 "A wooden bench for visitors. Someone has carved B.B. WAS HERE into the armrest."
#message 52 "No time to sit. It's your first week."
